### PhotoBase API — Manual smoke tests (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client)
### Base URL (adjust port if needed)
@baseUrl = https://localhost:7001

### ??????????????????????????????????????????????
### 1. Import plant records from TSV
### ??????????????????????????????????????????????
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/import/plant-records
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FormBoundary

------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="plant-records-sample.tsv"
Content-Type: text/tab-separated-values

AccessionNumber	PlantName	Location	CollectionTrip
2024-0001	Magnolia zenii	Garden A - Section 3	Spring 2024 East Asia
2024-0002	Quercus alba	Garden B - Oak Collection	Fall 2023 Appalachian
2024-0003	Acer palmatum	Garden C - Japanese Maples	
------FormBoundary--

### Expected: 200 OK with {"imported":N, "updated":N, "errors":0, ...}

### ??????????????????????????????????????????????
### 2. Search assets (empty gallery initially)
### ??????????????????????????????????????????????
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assets?page=1&pageSize=10

### Expected: 200 OK with PagedResult, items=[]

### ??????????????????????????????????????????????
### 3. Search with query
### ??????????????????????????????????????????????
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assets?query=Magnolia&page=1&pageSize=10

### Expected: 200 OK, filtered results

### ??????????????????????????????????????????????
### 4. Get asset detail (replace {id} with a real GUID)
### ??????????????????????????????????????????????
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Expected: 404 for fake ID; 200 with AssetDetailDto for real ID

### ??????????????????????????????????????????????
### 5. Get thumbnail (replace {id})
### ??????????????????????????????????????????????
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/thumb

### Expected: image/jpeg response

### ??????????????????????????????????????????????
### 6. Download original (replace {id})
### ??????????????????????????????????????????????
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/download

### Expected: file download with Content-Disposition: attachment

### ??????????????????????????????????????????????
### 7. Upload an image (use actual file via tool or curl)
### ??????????????????????????????????????????????
# curl example:
# curl -X POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assets \
#   -F "file=@./test-image.jpg" \
#   -F "Title=Test Magnolia" \
#   -F "AccessionNumber=2024-0001" \
#   -F "Keywords=magnolia,test"
#
# Expected: 201 Created with AssetDetailDto + Location header
